id: MergePerformerTagsToScenes
name: Merge Performer Tags To Scenes
metadata:
  description: Requires Stash 0.31.0 or newer. Merges performer tags into their scenes.
    Supports manual buttons (off by default) on performer and scene pages, auto-merge
    on save (off by default), and exclusion filters for organized scenes, tagged scenes,
    ignored tags, and tags marked via a custom field. The scene button stages tags
    in the edit form for review by default.
